  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>37360</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_001</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やった！　やったぜ、ついに！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yay! Finally!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>38024</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_002</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>クルルン！　クルルン！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Coorooroon! Coorooroon!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>38364</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_003</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>すごいね、&lt;Dio&gt;！
全コスチュームをマスターするなんて！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa, that's so cool &lt;Dio&gt;!
You've mastered all costumes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>38960</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_004</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へへ〜〜〜ん、オレに掛かりゃ、こんなもんだっての</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehe~ All a piece of cake!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>39476</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_005</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>見たか！　このタンス野郎が！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Did you see that, you enlarged cabinet?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>40288</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_006</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へん、すごすぎて、言葉もないってか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, nothing to say? Awed by my magnificence?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41024</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_007</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ったく、ギャーギャーうるせーのがおるだ。
そったらことで大騒ぎするなんて、器が小せぇ証拠だど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Blah, blah, blah, stop yapping! 
Only wimps let something this small inflate their ego.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42788</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_008</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おらだったら、サラッと流すだーよ。
大人っていうのは、そういうもんだ、ふん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Personally, I'd just let it be.
I am an adult, after all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43924</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_009</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へん！　くやしくてしょうがねーって、
顔に書いてあんぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehe, I can see it in your face, wardrobe. You're 
frustrated, but you can't do anything about it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44528</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>VCT_004_167_010</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だ！　え？　ど、ど、どったらとこに、書いてあるだ！
け、け、け、消す、今すぐ消すだ！　早く、早く！　ど、どこ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>M-Me!? Frustrated? Wh-Where on my face?
I-Is there an e-eraser somewhere? Eraser...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
